    ],
    "corpora": [
      "synth_core/fideon/synth_core/data/source data/<Carrier>/bldrk/ (5 documents: 3 seeds; Vacant Express's premium invoice and Zurich's scanned policy are not seeds)"
    ]
  },
  "fideon:blocks_used": [
    "locations",
    "buildings",
    "countersignature"
  ],
  "fideon:lob_block": "None. Each builders risk coverage (the building or structure under construction, renovations, existing buildings, soft costs, delay in completion, temporary storage, transit, the additional coverages and endorsements of the supplemental declarations) is a coverage with its limit, deductible and premium; the project site is a locations[] element and the project's building facts (construction, stories, square footage, occupancy on completion) a buildings[] element. The project facts the common model has no field for (project name and type, construction start and expected completion dates, completed value, hard and soft costs, percentage complete, general contractor, owner, renovation or new construction, reporting basis, rate) are additional_fields labels (SPEC_21 4.2.4; CHANGE_REQUESTS_builders_risk.md CR-BR-03).",
  "fideon:coverage_codes_file": "builders_risk.coverage_codes.yaml",
